> Trivandrum, September 3: The government hasdecided to build 100 rest houses for police officers across the State.
The decision came after years long complaint that the police officers doing VVIP and VIP duties are not getting enough place to rest after completing a day long duty.
Finance Department already availed Rs.51 crores for the purpose.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

